ch artist Jennifer Chevalier becomes embroiled in death, espionage and revolution, assisted by the ghost of Oscar Wilde. A hand-drawn Point & Click adventure with a unique comic book inventory design.", "themes": [{"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/jennifer-wilde-unlikely-revolutionaries", "videos": [{"id": 171511, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "TGwt50ZdCzk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TGwt50ZdCzk", "title": "Jennifer Wilde Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TGwt50ZdCzk/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}